  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a clay tajine over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and saut\u00013e until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add caraway seeds, all-purpose flour, and beet juice, stirring constantly to avoid lumps.",
    "Add pitted dates, maple syrup, cocoa powder, and salt, stirring to combine.",
    "Add 1 cup of water and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook for 10 minutes, or until the mixture has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in vegan butter until melted and smooth.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with additional almond praline if desired."
